{"_id":"69c6be6e5b2fa163d7a7f413","id":"Yuchn/event-graph-vjepa-vitl-dataset","author":"Yuchn","sha":"3545825d040250c99e079e958e7fd8dfa1cfa6ad","lastModified":"2026-03-27T17:47:02.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["task_categories:video-classification","language:ja","license:mit","size_categories:1K<n<10K","region:us","video-understanding","event-graph","vjepa","slot-attention","pytorch","synthetic-annotations"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEvent Graph Generation Dataset — V-JEPA 2.1 ViT-L Features + VLM Annotations\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t1. データセット概要\n\t\n\n動画から構造化されたイベントグラフ（誰が・何を・どこから・どこへ）を予測するための学習データセットです。\n室内環境（デスク・キッチン・部屋）の録画動画を対象に、以下の 2 種類のデータを含みます：\n\n映像特徴量（Features）: V-JEPA 2.1 ViT-L（frozen）で抽出した時空間トークン（PyTorch .pt 形式）\n合成アノテーション（Annotations）: Qwen 3.5 VLM による自動生成アノテーション（JSON 形式）。オブジェクト検出・イベント（行動）記述を含む\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t2. データの内容・件数\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n項目\n値\n\n\n\t\t\n動画数\n5\n\n\nクリップ数（16フレーム/クリップ）\n933\n\n\n特徴量サイズ合計\n17.61 GB\n\n\nアノテーション JSON\n5 ファイル… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Yuchn/event-graph-vjepa-vitl-dataset.","downloads":386,"likes":0,"cardData":{"license":"mit","tags":["video-understanding","event-graph","vjepa","slot-attention","pytorch","synthetic-annotations"],"task_categories":["video-classification"],"language":["ja"],"size_categories":["1K<n<10K"]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"LICENSE"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"annotations/20260316_192536_tp00010.json"},{"rfilename":"annotations/20260316_195628_tp00011.json"},{"rfilename":"annotations/20260316_221254_tp00015.json"},{"rfilename":"annotations/20260317_140300_tp00039.json"},{"rfilename":"annotations/20260318_094525_tp00067.json"},{"rfilename":"annotations_compact/20260316_192536_tp00010.json"},{"rfilename":"annotations_compact/20260316_195628_tp00011.json"},{"rfilename":"annotations_compact/20260316_221254_tp00015.json"},{"rfilename":"annotations_com